  "limitations": "Standing approval for independently inspected complete market composition: preserve the exact positive-kg esterquat supply mix and every original freight coefficient. Cut-off supply is 0.883720930232558 coconut/palm-kernel esterquat plus 0.116279069767442 tallow esterquat; consequential supply is wholly coconut/palm-kernel esterquat. Existing component correspondences use the matching UVEK feedstock-specific production processes, each with positive one-kg references. The coconut/palm-kernel processes consume 0.3 kg of each oil, while tallow processes consume 0.6 kg tallow per kg product. Do not replace the consequential credit with tallow production or cancel it against the tallow-treatment operating proxy. Inherit the component correspondences' heuristic, geography, allocation, feedstock, energy, emissions and freight approximations; no LCIA equivalence or exact marginal-production representation is established. No source component is omitted or normalized and no internal uncertainty/formulas are reconstructed. Preserve signed demand and recovery credits, supported caller uncertainty/formulas, foreground ownership and separately recorded emissions. Only inspected ecoinvent 3.6--3.12 cut-off/consequential profiles are approved; unknown/patch profiles remain blocked. The tallow-treatment service remains unapproved. No reverse is inferred; neither UVEK production endpoint currently has a reviewed reverse correspondence.",
